5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know how the current arrangement is failing socially. I’ll check the complaint log and the association minutes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m curious if the spots match where people actually park. I’ll look at the sticker register and the morning departures.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning shoving match is a safety hazard. I’ll examine the morning departures and the rain exposure.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Nobody checks the costs. I’ll review the building ledger and the ward cycle park fees.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to know the administrative burden. I’ll check the treasurer's file and the supplier's frame trial.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, checking the ledger is smart. But I worry about the social friction more than the money.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, the shoving match sounds stressful! I hope the sticker register shows who actually rides daily.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, it’s not just stress. It’s about who gets the dry spot. I need to see the rain exposure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, money causes friction too. If we don’t know the cost, we can’t plan. I’ll stick to the ledger.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the ledger shows past, not future. I need to know the effort to maintain a new system.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, effort matters, but so does fairness. I’ll see if the minutes show any past reviews.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I agree! Fairness is key. I’ll check if the daily riders are the same people every time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, consistency is good, but if the rain ruins the bike, consistency doesn’t help. I’ll check the rows.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, rain is a fact. Cost is a choice. I’ll see if the ward park is a viable alternative.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the ward park is external. I need to know the internal maintenance load. I’ll check the frame trial.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I’m set. I’ll check the complaint log and the five years of association minutes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m ready. I’ll check the sticker register and the morning departures watched from the entrance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll examine the morning departures and the rain exposure along the parking rows.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll review the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the treasurer's handover file and the trial of the supplier's display frame.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
